  "details": "I suggest giving players (or only group owners) the option to open an instance that will stay open indefinitely even when no players are there. \n\nI imagine it would be quite taxing on VRChat servers to leave instances open, so a solution would be to close the instance when no one is there, but then still have it show up for group members to join, and when the first player joins, it opens a new instance. \n\nThe idea is to have a hub for members to join and leave freely without the need for someone to manually open a new instance each time.",
